# Wrrapd.com default font (shopper site)

**Scope:** `wrrapd.com` shopper UI (pages, header, footer, account, login/register, `/buy/`, `pay.wrrapd.com`). Contractor portals (`apply` / `pros`) keep their own CSS.

## Default face

**Fraunces** for headings and body. New and updated shopper text uses Fraunces. Do not add a second face (Source Sans, DM Sans, Inter, Arial) on a new shopper page.

| Use | Weight |
|---|---|
| Headlines | 560 |
| Body | 460 |
| Buttons and labels | 650 |

Load it from Google Fonts with optical sizing:

`Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,460;0,9..144,560;0,9..144,650`

Stack: `Fraunces, Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif`. Set `font-optical-sizing: auto`.

Elementor and plugin CSS often set their own family with `!important`. Shopper snippets that must win use the same `!important` on the Wrrapd root, the way `/buy/` does on `.wrrapd-buy`.
